            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "At 70 degrees, most two-part epoxies are tack free in 8 to 12 hours, safe to walk on in 18 to 24 hours, ready for furniture in about three days, and ready for vehicle traffic in five to seven days. Full chemical cure takes 7 to 30 days depending on the product.",
